  "rationale": "Fix rolling idle hang by restoring positive dashpot decay rates in [ECM] 32984 across 0.0-0.6 lb/min airflow (0.00 -> 0.02-0.05), eliminating the frozen 0.60 lb/min dashpot air hold that required a throttle blip to clear. Increase in-gear engine braking by lowering [ECM] 44491 DFCO enable VSS to 14.0 mph, [ECM] 44492 DFCO disable VSS to 10.0 mph, and trimming 2,150 RPM dashpot pre-position air in [ECM] 32988 from 0.78 to 0.55 lb/min. Slightly increase overrun pops by retarding decel spark in [ECM] 44605 to -2.00 deg at 3,000 RPM and -4.00 deg at 4,000-6,000 RPM, and extending DFCO closed-throttle delay in [ECM] 44496 from 1.00s to 1.25s.",
